        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Natural plant growth and development achieved in the IPK PhenoSphere by dynamic environment simulation</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #f5f0ee;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  header {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8bbf3f, #a8cf4f);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 25px 40px 30px 40px;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  header h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 2.6em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n  header h2 {\n    margin: 8px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 1.6em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .logo-box {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 20px;\n    right: 40px;\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    color: #f3f3f3;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .logo-box .tower {\n    font-size: 2.5em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n  .container {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 18px;\n    padding: 18px 30px 30px 30px;\n  }\n  .full-width {\n    grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    background: white;\n    padding: 14px 20px;\n    font-size: 1.8em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #eee;\n  }\n  .section-body {\n    background: white;\n    padding: 18px 20px 25px 20px;\n    font-size: 1.05em;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .box {\n    background: white;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .results-columns {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  figure {\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  figcaption {\n    font-size: 1.05em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .fig1-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 3px;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 340px;\n  }\n  .fig1-grid .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .fig2-plot {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 220px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .fig3-plot {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 260px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .caption-text {\n    font-size: 1.05em;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .contact-info {\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .qr-box {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    right: 20px;\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: #eaf5c0;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 0.95em;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .conclusion-contact-wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  .watermark-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: center;\n    color: #ccc;\n    font-size: 2em;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    opacity: 0.5;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .watermark-text {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -8px;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #bbb;\n    font-size: 0.55em;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header>\n  <h1>Natural plant growth and development achieved in the IPK<br>PhenoSphere by dynamic environment simulation</h1>\n  <h2>(作者个人信息区)</h2>\n  <div class=\"logo-box\">\n    <span class=\"tower\">🗼</span>\n    <span>YuanBao<br>University<br>Zhumi</span>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n  <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n  <div class=\"box\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">INTRODUCTION</div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- METHODS -->\n  <div class=\"box\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">METHODS</div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RESULTS TITLE -->\n  <div class=\"box full-width\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">RESULTS</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RESULTS LEFT -->\n  <div class=\"box\">\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      <figure>\n        <figcaption>Fig. 1: The experimental sites at the IPK Gatersleben.</figcaption>\n        <div class=\"fig1-grid\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PhenoSphere exterior building]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Interior compartment with young plants]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Field rows of crops, sky background]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Interior compartment with mature plants]</div>\n        </div>\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"caption-text\">\n        a The PhenoSphere as seen from the outside. View into compartment 1 of the PhenoSphere early (b) and late (c) in the growth period. d The field 2016 at the IPK field site.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RESULTS RIGHT -->\n  <div class=\"box\">\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      <figure>\n        <figcaption>Fig. 2: Plant heights and growth speeds over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</figcaption>\n        <div class=\"placeholder fig2-plot\">[Chart: V-Stage and Leaf maturation line graphs, top-right]</div>\n      </figure>\n      <p>Fig. 3: Developmental stage progression and leaf maturation rates over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</p>\n      <div class=\"placeholder fig3-plot\">[Chart: 2x2 grid — V-Stage, Plants with tassel, Leaf maturation, Tassel occurrence line graphs]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- CONCLUSION + CONTACT -->\n  <div class=\"conclusion-contact-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">CONCLUSION</div>\n      <div class=\"section-body\">\n        The controlled environmental conditions are indeed spatially highly homogeneous across the cultivation areas of the PhenoSphere.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">CONTACT</div>\n      <div class=\"section-body\">\n        <div class=\"contact-info\">\n          Whatsapp：861356855××××<br>\n          Email：××××0825@gmail.com\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"watermark-row\">\n          <span>🪐</span><span>🪐</span><span>🪐</span><span>🪐</span>\n          <div class=\"watermark-text\">知乎 @ENGII组委会官方...</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qr-box\">Your<br>QR code</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
